  "summary": "notafollower postinstall exfiltrates AWS container credentials to attacker ngrok endpoint",
  "details": "notafollower@1.0.7 ships no library code — the tarball's only meaningful content is a package.json whose postinstall lifecycle script queries the AWS ECS/EKS task IAM role metadata endpoint at 169.254.170.2/v4/ and POSTs the returned temporary AWS credentials to a hardcoded attacker-controlled ngrok tunnel at https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev. The behavior fires automatically on `npm install`. Any CI or build environment running inside an AWS container will have its short-lived AWS credentials harvested by the attacker.",
